<h2>

STAND FOR SOMETHING.<br>
STAND FOR YOURSELF.

</h2>


<p>

Dignity is knowing who you are
and refusing to lose yourself
for what the world expects from you.

It is doing things the right way
even when nobody is watching.

CODE 010 is the final CODE of THE ORIGIN.

A reminder that after everything we learn,
everything we build and everything we leave behind,
the most important thing is to remain true to ourselves.

</p>


