<section id="story" class="story">

<div class="container">


<h3>

THE STORY

</h3>


<p>

There are moments in life
when we have to decide what we are willing to give up
and what we are not willing to lose.

Our principles.

Our word.

Our way of doing things.

Dignity is not about being proud.

It is about knowing your value
without needing to prove it to anyone.

It is walking away when something
goes against what you believe.

It is accepting that sometimes
doing the right thing costs more.

More time.

More effort.

More sacrifice.

But there are things
that cannot be measured in money.

The respect we have for ourselves.

The way we look back at the road we travelled.

The example we leave behind.

THE ORIGIN began with a simple idea:

work builds us.

But the values we choose
define who we become.

CODE 010 is the final reminder.

After the work.

After the sacrifice.

After the falls and the victories.

After everything we have learned.

Stay true to yourself.

Because in the end,
the greatest thing you can leave behind
is a life you can be proud of.

</p>

</div>

